<title>YUGOSLAVIA: SOCCER-YUGOSLAVIA 1 CZECH REPUBLIC 0 LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-YUGOSLAVIA 1 CZECH REPUBLIC 0 LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yugoslavia led the Czech</p>
<p>Republic 1-0 in their World Cup European group six match</p>
<p>qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Predrag Mijatovic 18</p>
